{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"6192bf8302a20700d883f8e27bea46437d6551e0edf9af2f3e111980a50fd0aa","digest":{"component_or_area":"Application-wide configuration resolution and authentication composition","key_entities":["OperationSnapshot","PydanticAIRunner","ProviderSession","GitRuntime","LLMRuntime","BridgeRuntime","REBAR_ROOT","REBAR_OPCERT_KEY_PATH","REBAR_OPCERT_PRIVATE_KEY","REBAR_OPERATION_SNAPSHOT_SHADOW","check_config_reads.py","ADR 0098","RP-01"],"problem_keywords":["operation-scoped configuration","provider authentication composition","credential handling","environment isolation","configuration precedence","runtime bindings","static secrets","op-cert startup"],"propositions":["Configuration must resolve once per operation boundary with immutable OperationSnapshot following precedence: explicit operation input > environment > project config > user config > schema default.","Authentication across LLM, Git, bridge, MCP, review-bot, observability, and op-cert must compose consistently without in-progress rereads of ambient state, files, or global config.","Provider-native auth/session capability must inject only through RP-01's existing PydanticAIRunner path, preserving budget, retry history, cache, accounting, exhaustion, artifacts, tracing, usage, and failure behavior.","Static secrets must use provider-specific Pydantic SecretStr/SecretBytes carriers revealed only in sending adapters, never stored in global environ or transmitted across unrelated sibling processes.","Op-cert must accept exactly one of REBAR_OPCERT_KEY_PATH or REBAR_OPCERT_PRIVATE_KEY, validate before service work, store in process-owned 0700/0600 copy, and rotate only on restart/redeploy.","Portable AST ownership gate must derive config/credential names from authoritative registries, reject unauthorized reads/reloads/defaults, permit only exact path/symbol+rationale exceptions, and reach zero legacy exceptions at cutover."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787318295411656001,"uuid":"25a08205-576c-4337-aaa1-76e1184cf91c"}